<title>CROATIA: TABLE-Viktor Lenac shipyard back to profit in 1996.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Viktor Lenac shipyard back to profit in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-06-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for calendar 1996 for Croatian repair docks Viktor Lenac.</p>
<p>(Millions of kuna unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    16.5	vs     -34.8</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		16.5	vs     -34.8</p>
<p>    Operating result	    21.8	vs     -12.1</p>
<p>    Total income		 168.6	vs     157.1</p>
<p>    Exports			159.7	vs     135.0</p>
<p>    Costs			  146.7	vs     169.2</p>
<p>NOTE -- Viktor Lenac obtained a full listing for its stock on the Zagreb Stock Exchange earlier this month. -- Zagreb newsroom +385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
